ss=\"hidden-mobile\"><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/tutors\">Find a Tutor</a><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/become-a-tutor\">Become a Tutor</a><div style=\"position:relative\"><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\">Subjects<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div style=\"position:relative\"><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\">Levels<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div style=\"position:relative\"><button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:#1a1a2e;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\">Coverage<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem\" class=\"hidden-mobile\"><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/login\">Log in</a><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1.25rem;background-color:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:0.5rem\" href=\"/register\">Sign Up</a></div><button style=\"background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;display:none\" class=\"show-mobile\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div><style>\n        @media (max-width: 768px) { .hidden-mobile { display: none !important; } .show-mobile { display: block !important; } }\n        @media (min-width: 769px) { .show-mobile { display: none !important; } }\n      </style></nav><main><div style=\"background-color:white\"><section style=\"background-color:#1a1a2e;padding:4rem 1.5rem;text-align:center\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;color:white\">Guide for Parents &amp; Students</h1></section><section style=\"padding:4rem 1.5rem\"><div style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><h2 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:1rem\">Step 1 — Create an Account</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65\">Sign up as a student and complete your 3-step onboarding with your personal info, current level, and subject preferences.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><h2 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:1rem\">Step 2 — Browse Tutors</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65\">Use our search and filter to find tutors by subject, level, city, budget, and teaching mode.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><h2 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:1rem\">Step 3 — Post a Request</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65\">Post a tuition request describing what you need. Verified tutors will place bids with their rates.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><h2 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:1rem\">Step 4 — Accept a Bid</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65\">Review bids and accept the best one. A booking will be created automatically.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\"><h2 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-size:1rem\">Step 5 — Pay &amp; Start Learning</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65\">Transfer payment to TUTORERA®&#x27;s bank account. Once confirmed, your sessions begin.</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:1rem\"><a style=\"background-color:#2563eb;color:white;padding:0.875rem 2rem;border-radius:0.5rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block\" href=\"/register\">Get Started</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer style=\"background-color:#